  "description": "BLACK+DECKER POWERSERIES Extreme Cordless Stick Vacuum... - Distributed/Packaged by Black+Decker. Product Details: BLACK+DECKER POWERSERIES Extreme Cordless Stick Vacuum... - Distributed/Packaged by Black+Decker. Product Details: BLACK+DECKER POWERSERIES Extreme Cordless Stick Vacuum Cleaner for Pets, Purple (BSV2020P) - Distributed/Packaged by Black+Decker. Product Details: Get 3x the clean with the POWERSERIES Extreme Pet 20V MAX* Cordless Stick Vacuum. This cordless vacuum features an angled floorhead that’s designed for multiple surfaces, from hardwood to area rugs to carpets -- just use the 3-speed control to make your selection. The v-shaped bristle pattern tackles all types of messes, including pet hair, dust, and crumbs, and the patented anti-tangle brush bar minimizes hair wrap to maximize suction power. For added power, the twist-to-clean filter amps up the suction even more, while 55 minutes of runtime ensures long-lasting use. The stick vacuum also features LED lights on the floorhead, helping you to zero in on hidden dirt, and it evenconverts to a handheld vacuum with an extra-long crevice tool for those hard-to-reach spaces. Emptying debris is simple thanks to a front-facing dustbin, which also allows the vacuum to lay flat for cleaning tough-to-reach areas. And when you’re done, simply remove the 20V MAX* battery to charge it separately -- or leave it attached for simple charging while the vacuum stands on its own or hangs from its wall mount. *Maximum initial battery voltage (measured without a workload) is 20 volts. Nominal voltage is 18 volts. Dustbin Capacity .75 Liter.",
